@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/driver#> .
@prefix courier: <http://example.org/orexis/courier#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix planning: <http://example.org/orexis/planning#> .

<> a planning:ConstraintGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  TWO CONSTRAINTS, both physics and neither a preference: what the world says is POSSIBLE, held by
#  the agent and weighed in every possible world it searches (knowledge/domain/planning/constraint.md).
#
#  NO CELL HOLDS TWO VANS, the dispatcher's, stated here because it is as true of this world: on two
#  grids no drive crosses it can never be broken, and over what the vans can reach it yields no row,
#  so it couples nothing here.
#
#  A DRIVER IS ABOARD ONE VAN AT A TIME, which is what "one van at a time" IS in a world with a
#  driver. No plan breaks it — a boarding takes away the van the driver leaves, so it is weighed in
#  every world and marks none impossible — and it is stated for what its FOOTPRINT says: the
#  derivation couples two parcels into one want where some constraint's rows, read over the
#  delete-free reach of the actions, join what each parcel's van is, and in that reach the driver
#  boards both vans and is aboard both. So a plan for either parcel moves the driver a plan for the
#  other needs, the two are one want and one search, and the plan drives one van, boards the other
#  and drives it (one-mind-couples-the-wants-a-constraint-can-make-collide). Without it the two
#  parcels were two wants and two plans, and walked side by side van A was driven with the driver
#  aboard van B — measured, `tests/test_driver.py`.

:dispatcher planning:holds :no_cell_holds_two_vans .

:no_cell_holds_two_vans a planning:Constraint ;
    rdfs:label "no cell holds two vans" ;
    planning:unmetWhen :two_vans_on_one_cell .

:two_vans_on_one_cell
    sh:message "two vans stand on one cell" ;
    sh:select """PREFIX courier: <http://example.org/orexis/courier#>
        SELECT $this ?value WHERE {
            $this a courier:Van ;
                courier:at ?value .
            ?other a courier:Van ;
                courier:at ?value .
            FILTER(?other != $this)
        }""" .

:dispatcher planning:holds :a_driver_is_aboard_one_van .

:a_driver_is_aboard_one_van a planning:Constraint ;
    rdfs:label "a driver is aboard one van at a time" ;
    planning:unmetWhen :a_driver_aboard_two_vans .

:a_driver_aboard_two_vans
    sh:message "a driver is aboard two vans" ;
    sh:select """PREFIX courier: <http://example.org/orexis/courier#>
        SELECT $this ?value WHERE {
            $this a courier:Driver ;
                courier:aboard ?value .
            $this courier:aboard ?other .
            FILTER(?other != ?value)
        }""" .
